# SSOT Requirement (hard fail)
- Commands to run **before** approving/merging:
```bash
python scripts/verify_ssot_bundle.py
python scripts/mcp_sync.py && python scripts/logging_schema_check.py
python -c "from src.mcp_servers.phase9_mcp_server import Phase9MCPServer; print(Phase9MCPServer().validate_cursor_rules())"
python -c "from src.mcp_servers.living_truth_fastmcp_server import validate_cursor_rules; print(validate_cursor_rules())"
```
- On any failure: **stop** and remediate. Approvals are blocked until PASS.

# Commit Discipline
- Require `[SSOT Verified]` in commit message once SSOT checks pass.

# Prohibited
- Duplicate SSOT files outside root.
- Merging with failing SSOT Guard or Repo Health checks.